# Thin control-plane runtime dependencies (future Lambda handlers, Phase 3+).
#
# No scientific stack: numpy, scipy, pandas, statsmodels, arch, matplotlib,
# streamlit and plotly are all forbidden here (architecture plan Section 7.3,
# enforced by tests/test_control_plane_purity.py). A control-plane cold start
# has no reason to pay for a scientific dependency closure.
#
# pydantic: request/response schemas shared with scenario_platform.domain
# (architecture plan Section 7.4, "shared contract without shared runtime").
#
# boto3: Phase 3b's three control-plane Lambdas (submit, jobs, classify_failure)
# talk to DynamoDB, Step Functions and ECS directly -- a different plane from
# scenario_platform.domain/worker, where boto3 remains banned (AGENTS.md
# invariant 28, tests/test_no_aws_in_core.py). The AWS-provided Lambda runtime
# already bundles a recent boto3/botocore, so this pin only fixes what the
# control-plane zip itself carries for local testing and reproducibility, not
# what actually executes in Lambda.
pydantic>=2,<3
